      "Conversation.Company.Heading": "你想要怎样的陪伴？",
      "Conversation.Company.Question.Soft": "现在，怎样的陪伴会让你舒服些？",
      "Conversation.Company.Question.Direct": "现在最需要我帮你做什么？",
      "Conversation.Company.Question.Playful": "得力助手、捣蛋搭档，还是安静的小影子？",
      "Conversation.Company.Choices.First": "继续帮我收集附近的掉落物。",
      "Conversation.Company.Choices.Second": "来点乐趣吧，活泼一点！",
      "Conversation.Company.Choices.Third": "请温柔地陪着我就好。",
      "Conversation.Company.Choices.Later": "我们晚点再聊吧。",
      "Conversation.Company.Reply.Direct": "明白。附近的掉落物交给我，我也会把话说清楚。",
      "Conversation.Company.Reply.Playful": "那就是冒险搭档啦！保证只捣一点点，绝对合理的乱。",
      "Conversation.Company.Reply.Soft": "我在。再温柔一点，再靠近一点。",
      "Conversation.Wallet.Heading": "有东西给你",
      "Conversation.Wallet.Choices.First": "谢谢！把钱给我吧。",
      "Conversation.Wallet.Choices.Second": "继续替我们攒着吧。",
      "Conversation.Wallet.Choices.Third": "瞧我们这对宝藏猎人！",
      "Conversation.Wallet.Choices.Later": "现在不用，先保管好。",
      "Conversation.Wallet.Delivered": "给你！已经稳稳放进你的口袋了。",
      "Conversation.Wallet.Partial": "给你！放不下的我先替你保管。",
      "Conversation.Wallet.Full": "你的口袋满了。别担心，每一枚钱币都在我这里好好的。",
      "Conversation.Wallet.Saving": "明白。我们的积蓄就先放我这儿。",
      "Conversation.Wallet.TreasureHunters": "双魂寻宝行动！我们的闪亮小金库就由我守着。",
      "Conversation.Wallet.Curious.Line0": "给你！我找到{0}。看看能买些什么？",
      "Conversation.Wallet.Curious.Line1": "小发现攒成了{0}。要吗？",
      "Conversation.Wallet.Loyal.Line0": "给你！我保管了{0}。想拿走吗？",
      "Conversation.Wallet.Loyal.Line1": "旅途上的一点心意：{0}。交给你？",
      "Conversation.Wallet.Brave.Line0": "给你！冒险赚来了{0}。要拿你那份吗？",
      "Conversation.Wallet.Brave.Line1": "准备好下一场冒险了吗？我有{0}可以添点补给。",
      "Conversation.Wallet.Gentle.Line0": "给你！一点小心意，{0}。让我交给你好吗？",
      "Conversation.Wallet.Gentle.Line1": "你已经背得够多了。我替你攒了{0}。",
      "Conversation.Wallet.Mischievous.Line0": "给你！{0}，合法所得。大概是在开玩笑啦。要吗？",
      "Conversation.Wallet.Mischievous.Line1": "我的口袋叮当响：{0}。你的也可以哦！",
      "Conversation.Chatter.Soft.Line0": "不着急。我喜欢这样陪着你。",
      "Conversation.Chatter.Soft.Line1": "小小的发现也很珍贵。",
      "Conversation.Chatter.Soft.Line2": "我听着呢。我们可以慢慢来。",
      "Conversation.Chatter.Direct.Line0": "保持跟随，留意下一件有用的发现。",
      "Conversation.Chatter.Direct.Line1": "随时准备出发。",
      "Conversation.Chatter.Direct.Line2": "一次一件事。我们正在前进。",
