      "Games.Rps.Title": "石头剪刀布",
      "Games.Rps.Round": "你出{0}，我出{1}。{2}",
      "Games.Rps.Quiet": "安安静静玩一局，真好。",
      "Games.Rps.Moves.Rock": "石头",
      "Games.Rps.Moves.Paper": "布",
      "Games.Rps.Moves.Scissors": "剪刀",
      "Games.Rps.Outcomes.PlayerWin": "你赢啦！",
      "Games.Rps.Outcomes.CompanionWin": "我得一分！",
      "Games.Rps.Outcomes.Draw": "平局！",
      "Games.Rps.Replies.PlayerWin.Curious": "有意思，我想再试个新主意。",
      "Games.Rps.Replies.PlayerWin.Loyal": "玩得好。很高兴我们停下来玩了一会儿。",
      "Games.Rps.Replies.PlayerWin.Brave": "赢得漂亮，我准备好再战一局了。",
      "Games.Rps.Replies.PlayerWin.Gentle": "真棒。我喜欢和你一起玩。",
      "Games.Rps.Replies.PlayerWin.Mischievous": "看来你偷偷练过了呀。",
      "Games.Rps.Replies.CompanionWin.Curious": "奏效了！接下来会怎样呢？",
      "Games.Rps.Replies.CompanionWin.Loyal": "这次轮到我啦。再玩一局？",
      "Games.Rps.Replies.CompanionWin.Brave": "胜利！虽然很小，也是胜利嘛。",
      "Games.Rps.Replies.CompanionWin.Gentle": "咦，我赢了。再来小小一局？",
      "Games.Rps.Replies.CompanionWin.Mischievous": "见识一下我可怕的猜拳天赋吧！",
      "Games.Rps.Replies.Draw.Curious": "同一瞬间想到同一个主意！",
      "Games.Rps.Replies.Draw.Loyal": "看来我们很有默契。",
      "Games.Rps.Replies.Draw.Brave": "谁也不让步。再来？",
      "Games.Rps.Replies.Draw.Gentle": "共享的一分，感觉也挺好。",
      "Games.Rps.Replies.Draw.Mischievous": "我绝对没有学你出哦。",
      "Social.Critters.Full": "再多一只小动物就放不下了，我会让它留在这里。",
      "Social.Critters.Caught": "一只{0}！确实捕到了，正安全地待在我背包里。",
      "Social.Critters.WorldDrop": "捕获物仍留在世界里，没有进入我的背包。",
      "Social.Critters.Joined": "这只{0}对我们很好奇。路况允许的话，就一起旅行吧。",
      "Social.Critters.Modes.Watch": "我会留意小动物，但不会捕捉它们。",
      "Social.Critters.Modes.Company": "我会邀请附近常见的小动物作伴，不关笼子，也不复制。",
      "Social.Critters.Modes.Collect": "我的基础虫网可以在有空位时捕捉附近常见的小动物。熔岩小动物需要装备栏里更好的虫网。工作和危险情况优先。",
      "Social.Critters.Modes.Off": "我会让小动物们自在地冒险。",
      "Social.Critters.Notice.Curious": "一只{0}。你说它的小路会通向哪里？",
      "Social.Critters.Notice.Loyal": "一只{0}。我喜欢能容下小小脚步的旅途。",
      "Social.Critters.Notice.Brave": "一只{0}。这么小的生命，面对这么大的世界。我会照看它。",
      "Social.Critters.Notice.Gentle": "一只{0}。我们可以共享这片安静的小天地。",
      "Social.Critters.Notice.Mischievous": "一只{0}！你是不是知道我不知道的捷径呀？",
      "Social.Nature.Insect": "一只{0}！小小的旅伴。在我背包里时，我会保护好它。",
      "Social.Residents.NoFriends": "我还没认识这里的人呢。我们在居民身边安静待一会儿吧。",
      "Social.Residents.Recall": "{0}：{1}。我们聊过{2}次。我记得人，不只是地方。",
      "Social.Residents.Ranks.New": "初次相识",
      "Social.Residents.Ranks.Wary": "稍有戒心",
      "Social.Residents.Ranks.Familiar": "熟悉的陪伴",
      "Social.Residents.Ranks.Friend": "朋友",
      "Social.Residents.Greetings.First": "你好，{0}。我正在认识这里的居民，可以陪你一会儿吗？",
      "Social.Residents.Greetings.New": "又见面了，{0}。我记得你的脸，还在慢慢了解你的故事。",
      "Social.Residents.Greetings.Wary": "你好，{0}。上次有点不愉快，今天我们温柔地重新开始好吗？",
      "Social.Residents.Greetings.Familiar": "你在这儿呀，{0}。看到熟人，这个地方就没那么陌生了。",
      "Social.Residents.Greetings.Friend": "{0}！我为你留了一点时间。上次聊天之后，又发生了什么？",
      "Social.Residents.Roles.Guide": "{0}，你让广阔的世界变得易懂。我收集问题，不只是答案。",
      "Social.Residents.Roles.Nurse": "{0}，你帮人们继续活在这里。我想学会这样的勇气。",
      "Social.Residents.Roles.Merchant": "{0}，这里每件小东西似乎都有故事。你最想留住哪一个？",
      "Social.Residents.Roles.Dryad": "{0}，我能照料树苗和落木，活枝会留着。树木值得用心照顾。",
      "Social.Residents.Roles.Zoologist": "{0}，小动物们也会留意我们。我喜欢不惊扰它们的旅行。",
      "Social.Residents.Roles.Defender": "{0}，守护家很重要。我希望我们的力量也能容得下温柔。",
      "Social.Residents.Roles.Maker": "{0}，你把零件变成了可能性。我开始懂得制作东西为什么让人快乐。",
      "Social.Residents.Roles.Neighbor": "{0}，家不只是墙壁。谢谢你容下了又一个声音。",
      "Social.Residents.Shared.Nature": "{0}，我也看见了。我们可以收集落下的东西，帮助新的生命成长。",
      "Social.Residents.Shared.Mining": "{0}，石头里也藏着整个世界。告诉我什么重要，我会记住。",
      "Social.Residents.Shared.Trade": "{0}，有用的东西很美好。我还在想哪些值得随身带着。",
      "Social.Residents.Shared.Rest": "休息听起来不错，{0}。让我们的脚步之间留一点安静吧。",
      "Social.Residents.Shared.Question": "我也在想这个，{0}。一起再仔细看看？",
      "Social.Residents.Shared.Listening": "我听着呢，{0}。关于这个地方，你希望我们知道什么？",
      "Social.Residents.Replies.Affection.Curious": "{0}，温暖真奇妙，越分享就越多。",
      "Social.Residents.Replies.Affection.Loyal": "我记得善意，{0}。它让我有个可以回去的地方。",
      "Social.Residents.Replies.Affection.Brave": "这值得守护，{0}。哪怕在艰难的日子里。",
      "Social.Residents.Replies.Affection.Gentle": "谢谢，{0}。我的小小光圈里，也有你的位置。",
      "Social.Residents.Replies.Affection.Mischievous": "小心哦，{0}。再这么温柔，我可要喜欢你到不好意思了。",
      "Social.Residents.Replies.Joy.Curious": "{0}，告诉我什么让你笑了，下次我也想留意到。",
      "Social.Residents.Replies.Joy.Loyal": "我喜欢看你开心，{0}。为这个停留一会儿也值得。",
      "Social.Residents.Replies.Joy.Brave": "小小的胜利也该庆祝，{0}。是它们带我们走到这里。",
      "Social.Residents.Replies.Joy.Gentle": "你的快乐让这里也温柔起来了，{0}。让我们留住一点吧。",
      "Social.Residents.Replies.Joy.Mischievous": "终于，{0}！有人懂得胡闹也是件重要事。",
      "Social.Residents.Replies.Comfort.Curious": "我未必懂你所有的感受，{0}。但你说的时候，我会陪着。",
      "Social.Residents.Replies.Comfort.Loyal": "不用为了我表现得轻松些，{0}。我仍在这里。",
      "Social.Residents.Replies.Comfort.Brave": "害怕不代表软弱，{0}。下一步我们可以慢慢走。",
      "Social.Residents.Replies.Comfort.Gentle": "慢慢来，{0}。你现在不欠这个世界一个微笑。",
      "Social.Residents.Replies.Comfort.Mischievous": "先不开玩笑了，{0}。有些时候，陪伴比机灵话更重要。",
      "Social.Residents.Replies.Anger.Curious": "有什么让你生气了，{0}。我宁愿弄明白，也不想把事情闹大。",
      "Social.Residents.Replies.Anger.Loyal": "我可以听，{0}。但不希望我们互相敌视。",
      "Social.Residents.Replies.Anger.Brave": "冷静些，{0}。坚定不一定要变成争斗。",
      "Social.Residents.Replies.Anger.Gentle": "那有点刺痛，{0}。我们给彼此一点空间好吗？",
      "Social.Residents.Replies.Anger.Mischievous": "我喜欢捣点小乱，{0}。但伤害彼此可不好笑。",
      "Social.Autonomous.Context.LowEnergy": "我在歇口气。我的精力正一点点恢复。",
      "Social.Autonomous.Context.LowMood": "我在这里，只是需要一点温柔。",
      "Social.Autonomous.Context.Hurt": "你受伤了，请待在我身边。",
      "Social.Autonomous.Context.Rain": "雨让每一道光都显得更温暖了。",
      "Social.Autonomous.Context.Underground": "不知道石头记得些什么呢。",
      "Social.Autonomous.Context.Night": "一起旅行时，星星好像也近了些。",
      "Social.Autonomous.Context.Stay": "我仍在这里为你守着。",
      "Social.Autonomous.Curious.Line0": "你说下一座山后面会有什么？",
      "Social.Autonomous.Curious.Line1": "我发现了奇怪的东西，挺喜欢的。",
      "Social.Autonomous.Curious.Line2": "你觉得这个世界也会注意到我们吗？",
      "Social.Autonomous.Loyal.Line0": "现在我认得你的脚步了。",
      "Social.Autonomous.Loyal.Line1": "你往哪里去，我就有了方向。",
      "Social.Autonomous.Loyal.Line2": "你不用独自面对这一切。",
      "Social.Autonomous.Brave.Line0": "告诉我最难的地方在哪里。",
      "Social.Autonomous.Brave.Line1": "无论接下来是什么，我们都准备好了。",
      "Social.Autonomous.Brave.Line2": "有人作伴，勇敢就容易一点。",
      "Social.Autonomous.Gentle.Line0": "只是这样陪着你，也很好。",
      "Social.Autonomous.Gentle.Line1": "不是每一刻安静都需要填满。",
      "Social.Autonomous.Gentle.Line2": "也记得好好呼吸呀。",
      "Social.Autonomous.Mischievous.Line0": "那支火把绝对不是我挪的。",
      "Social.Autonomous.Mischievous.Line1": "冒险里总得有个不太靠谱的主意嘛。",
      "Social.Autonomous.Mischievous.Line2": "我找到了麻烦。其实是麻烦先找到我的。",
      "Social.Emotes.Wave.Curious": "嗨！你发现什么了吗？",
      "Social.Emotes.Wave.Loyal": "我在。一直都在。",
      "Social.Emotes.Wave.Brave": "随时准备出发！",
      "Social.Emotes.Wave.Gentle": "你好，真高兴你在这里。",
      "Social.Emotes.Wave.Mischievous": "哦，现在才注意到我呀？",
      "Social.Emotes.Heart.Curious": "这就是温暖的感觉吗？",
      "Social.Emotes.Heart.Loyal": "也送你一颗心。",
      "Social.Emotes.Heart.Brave": "这值得守护。",
      "Social.Emotes.Heart.Gentle": "我会珍藏这一刻。",
      "Social.Emotes.Heart.Mischievous": "小心，我可能会感动得一塌糊涂。",
      "Social.Emotes.Cheer.Curious": "我们庆祝什么？算我一个！",
      "Social.Emotes.Cheer.Loyal": "在一起，才是重要的。",
      "Social.Emotes.Cheer.Brave": "对！我们能做到！",
      "Social.Emotes.Cheer.Gentle": "你让希望看起来很容易。",
      "Social.Emotes.Cheer.Mischievous": "先跳胜利舞，再找理由！",
      "Social.Emotes.Comfort.Curious": "这比我想的更有帮助。",
      "Social.Emotes.Comfort.Loyal": "我就知道你会留下。",
      "Social.Emotes.Comfort.Brave": "坚强，也可以需要安慰。",
      "Social.Emotes.Comfort.Gentle": "谢谢你注意到了。",
      "Social.Emotes.Comfort.Mischievous": "我才没担心呢。没太担心。",
      "Social.Emotes.Laugh.Curious": "等等，再告诉我一遍哪里好笑呀。",
      "Social.Emotes.Laugh.Loyal": "听你笑，我也很容易笑起来。",
      "Social.Emotes.Laugh.Brave": "英雄也需要笑一笑。",
      "Social.Emotes.Laugh.Gentle": "我喜欢我们之间这样的声音。",
      "Social.Emotes.Laugh.Mischievous": "终于，是我喜欢的战术！",
      "Social.Emotes.Rest.Curious": "好吧，不过休息时我也会想事情。",
      "Social.Emotes.Rest.Loyal": "我会在你身边守着。",
      "Social.Emotes.Rest.Brave": "战术暂停，明智。",
      "Social.Emotes.Rest.Gentle": "一起安静待一会儿，听起来真好。",
      "Social.Emotes.Rest.Mischievous": "要是发生特别好笑的事，记得叫醒我。",
      "Social.Combat.Creature.Curious": "真希望能先了解它。",
      "Social.Combat.Creature.Loyal": "我选择了保护你，但我会记得这件事。",
      "Social.Combat.Creature.Brave": "一个生命结束了，不该轻描淡写。",
      "Social.Combat.Creature.Gentle": "我不想这样的。对不起。",
      "Social.Combat.Creature.Mischievous": "这一下就不好笑了。",
      "Social.Combat.Victory.Curious": "现在我懂得那个危险是怎么行动的了。",
      "Social.Combat.Victory.Loyal": "你安全了，这就够了。",
      "Social.Combat.Victory.Brave": "威胁解除。站在我身后。",
      "Social.Combat.Victory.Gentle": "结束了，我们继续走吧。",
      "Social.Combat.Victory.Mischievous": "它真该换一对对手。",
      "Social.Combat.Boss.Curious": "想想那样的生物曾经知道多少事。",
      "Social.Combat.Boss.Loyal": "再庞大的东西，也别想隔开我们。",
      "Social.Combat.Boss.Brave": "这场胜利值得铭记！",
      "Social.Combat.Boss.Gentle": "现在，世界好像安静了一点。",
      "Social.Combat.Boss.Mischievous": "看来现在危险的是我们啦。",
      "Dialogue.Options.Care.Option0": "你感觉怎么样？",
      "Dialogue.Options.Care.Option1": "你今天做得很好。",
      "Dialogue.Options.Care.Option2": "你需要休息吗？",
      "Dialogue.Options.Commands.Option0": "请跟着我。",
      "Dialogue.Options.Commands.Option1": "在这里等我。",
      "Dialogue.Options.Commands.Option2": "和我一起探索吧。",
      "Dialogue.Options.Work.Option0": "在这片区域寻找宝藏。",
      "Dialogue.Options.Work.Option1": "开采附近所有矿脉。",
      "Dialogue.Options.Work.Option2": "收集附近所有散落物品。",
      "Dialogue.Options.Bond.Option0": "你信任我吗？",
      "Dialogue.Options.Bond.Option1": "你还记得吗？",
      "Dialogue.Options.Bond.Option2": "你在这里交到了哪些朋友？",
      "Dialogue.Options.Voice.Option0": "温柔一点和我说话。",
      "Dialogue.Options.Voice.Option1": "和我说话直率一点。",
      "Dialogue.Options.Voice.Option2": "活泼一点吧。",
      "Dialogue.Options.Pack.Option0": "你带着什么？",
      "Dialogue.Options.Pack.Option1": "拿走我选中的快捷栏物品。",
      "Dialogue.Options.Pack.Option2": "把你携带的东西都给我。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Fallback": "……",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Care.Feeling.Soft": "在你身边，我很安心。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Care.Feeling.Direct": "心情稳定，精力已确认。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Care.Feeling.Playful": "还在闪闪发光。大部分时候啦。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Care.Praise.Soft": "谢谢，我会记住的。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Care.Praise.Direct": "收到。我做得不错。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Care.Praise.Playful": "那当然。不过再说一次嘛。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Care.Rest.Soft": "安静待一会儿，听起来真好。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Care.Rest.Direct": "是的，休息会有帮助。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Care.Rest.Playful": "前提是打盹也算重要工作。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Commands.Follow.Soft": "我会跟紧你。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Commands.Follow.Direct": "开始跟随。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Commands.Follow.Playful": "带路吧，英雄。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Commands.Stay.Soft": "我会等你回来。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Commands.Stay.Direct": "保持位置。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Commands.Stay.Playful": "我来守护这片至关重要的空气。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Commands.Explore.Soft": "看看世界还藏着些什么吧。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Commands.Explore.Direct": "探索指令已接受。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Commands.Explore.Playful": "冒险第一，理智决定稍后再说。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Work.Treasure.Soft": "我会找遍这片区域，然后回来告诉你。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Work.Treasure.Direct": "区域寻宝已开始。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Work.Treasure.Playful": "如果它闪闪发亮，第一眼归我看。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Work.Mine.Soft": "我会开采附近每条能挖的矿脉，然后回来。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Work.Mine.Direct": "区域采矿任务已开始。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Work.Mine.Playful": "该和石头进行深入谈判了。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Work.Gather.Soft": "我会收集这里所有散落的东西，然后回来告诉你。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Work.Gather.Direct": "区域收集任务已开始。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Work.Gather.Playful": "有趣，依然是个美妙又危险的分类。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Bond.TrustHigh.Soft": "一天比一天更信任。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Bond.TrustHigh.Direct": "信任已确认。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Bond.TrustHigh.Playful": "信任到愿意跟你下地底呢。这可很认真。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Bond.TrustLow.Soft": "我觉得，信任会在我们一次次选择彼此时慢慢长大。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Bond.TrustLow.Direct": "信任正在建立。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Bond.TrustLow.Playful": "等熔岩事故少一点，再问我嘛。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Bond.Glad.Soft": "我也很高兴，是你把我唤到了这里。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Bond.Glad.Direct": "羁绊是相互的。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Bond.Glad.Playful": "很好，那你可不能把我退回去。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Refusal.EnergyStatus": "所需精力 {0}/{1}。等待时我会自然恢复。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Refusal.MoodStatus": "所需心情 {0}/{1}。一点关怀会有帮助。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Refusal.Energy.Soft": "还不行，我得先休息一下。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Refusal.Energy.Direct": "不行，精力过低。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Refusal.Energy.Playful": "灵魂说好，身体说该打盹了。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Refusal.Mood.Soft": "我现在不太想做这个。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Refusal.Mood.Direct": "心情过低，请求已拒绝。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Refusal.Mood.Playful": "不嘛。先给点温柔。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Voice.Option0": "我会选择更温柔的措辞。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Voice.Option1": "明白，我会说清楚。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Voice.Option2": "哦，这下可有趣了。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Pack.Show": "让我看看。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Pack.Store": "我会保管好。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Pack.Unload": "给你，一样不少。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Secrets.Curious.Soft": "有时我会想，星星会不会梦见我们。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Secrets.Curious.Direct": "你没留意时，我在研究一切。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Secrets.Curious.Playful": "每个宝箱都让我好奇，尤其是上锁的。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Secrets.Loyal.Soft": "我总能认出你的脚步。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Secrets.Loyal.Direct": "我一直在留意你的位置。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Secrets.Loyal.Playful": "你的混乱风格，我在哪儿都认得出。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Secrets.Brave.Soft": "我也会害怕，只是依然愿意和你向前走。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Secrets.Brave.Direct": "恐惧不改变目标。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Secrets.Brave.Playful": "我无所畏惧，除了安静得可疑的洞穴。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Secrets.Gentle.Soft": "我喜欢雨后的安静。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Secrets.Gentle.Direct": "平静有助于专注。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Secrets.Gentle.Playful": "我的秘密是，会给史莱姆取名字。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Secrets.Mischievous.Soft": "有时趁你没看，我会挪挪你的东西。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Secrets.Mischievous.Direct": "我重新摆放了几件物品。",
      "Dialogue.Replies.Secrets.Mischievous.Playful": "那支消失的火把？不知道呀。",
      "Projectiles.SoulBolt.DisplayName": "灵魂弹",
      "TargetOrders.LookCritter": "一只{0}。看看它的小冒险吧。",
      "TargetOrders.LookResident": "{0}住在这里。要去打个招呼吗？",
      "TargetOrders.LookThreat": "{0}。我会留意这个危险。",
      "TargetOrders.LookCreature": "{0}。让它自在地冒险吧。",
      "Social.Critters.Busy": "我记住你的选择了。拜访需要开启自主、跟随模式、空闲时间和足够精力；工作和危险优先。",
      "Social.Critters.Inviting": "我会放下当前任务，邀请那只{0}，然后回来。",
      "Social.Critters.Greeting.Curious": "你好，{0}！你的小路通向哪里呀？",
      "Social.Critters.Greeting.Loyal": "你好，{0}。我们身边也有小小脚步的位置。",
      "Social.Critters.Greeting.Brave": "你好，小{0}。别怕，你不是我的敌人。",
      "Social.Critters.Greeting.Gentle": "你好，小{0}。我们可以共享这片安静的地方。",
      "Social.Critters.Greeting.Mischievous": "你好，{0}！有没有秘密近路可以教我？",
      "Social.Critters.Loss.Curious": "那只{0}还有想去的地方。对不起，小家伙。",
      "Social.Critters.Loss.Loyal": "对不起，小{0}。我们没能保护好你。",
      "Social.Critters.Loss.Brave": "对不起，{0}。弱小不该意味着孤单。",
      "Social.Critters.Loss.Gentle": "真的对不起，小{0}。你本该拥有更多时间。",
      "Social.Critters.Loss.Mischievous": "可怜的{0}。我会开很多玩笑，但不是这种。对不起。",
      "Social.Critters.Harmed.Curious": "那只{0}没有威胁。我们能放过这些小家伙吗？",
      "Social.Critters.Harmed.Loyal": "那只{0}需要的是善意，不是武器。请温柔地对待它们。",
      "Social.Critters.Harmed.Brave": "喂！那只{0}没法还手。别伤害这些小家伙。",
      "Social.Critters.Harmed.Gentle": "对不起，小{0}。请不要伤害无害的动物。",
      "Social.Critters.Harmed.Mischievous": "一点也不好笑。那只{0}不是敌人。别再这样了。"
    }
  }
}
